from  green and glitzy to a well-loved hoodie  you gotta look back at audrey hepburn  for an uh  funny face she also wore a hoodie um  no that's not true the stars brought  their fashion a game to the 78th annual  golden globes on sunday night although  it was a completely virtual affair  due to the kovid 19 crisis celebrities  still dressed to impress showing off  some major fashion moments while  celebrating the year's  best in tv and film oh i'm desperate for  a christian moment  i'll give it to you i promise amanda  seifried  promised e.t a fashion moment and  she delivered in her custom strapless  coral oscar de la renta dress which  featured  hand-crafted taffeta silk flowers  singer turned actress andra day stunned  in a custom gorgeous gray chanel gown  with her hair pulled back as she  accepted her award  for best actress in a motion picture  drama for her portrayal of the iconic  billie holiday  in the united states versus billie  holiday  from home to all the incredible nominees  i can't believe i'm in the presence of  giants  shades of green were on theme during a  sunday show  as cynthia arrivo was daring in this  structured  neon valentino couture dress as she  attended the actual event  to present cynthia's futuristic look  styled by jason bolden was accessorized  with metallic  silver platform wedges ivory opera  length  leather gloves and purple eyeliner  leslie odom jr also donned a pop of neon  underneath his maison valentino suit  while dan levy was chic in chartreuse  wowing in this valentino getup for the  award show  complete with a matching sequin  turtleneck  platform metallic shoes and his  signature  spectacles  the queen's gambit star anya taylor joy  was the queen of old hollywood glamour  as she stepped out in a sparkling  emerald dior  oate couture gown with a plunging  neckline  and a matching floor-length coat  with the help of her stylist la roach  anya looked  fabulous in over one million dollars  worth of tiffany and code diamonds  i don't think my body understands what's  going on intellectually i kind of do but  my body's going to take a bit of time  but i'm happy  i'm really happy spike lee's sun and  golden globe ambassador  jackson lee wore a green kimono inspired  custom gucci coat he paired with a black  suit  and matching bolo tie and a time's up  pin congratulations catherine o'hara you  are a queen  and icon and i will happily lose to you  any single day  while kaylee cuoco didn't take home the  golden globe for best actress in a  musical or comedy series  for her role in flight attendant she won  us  over when it came to her sparkling  fashion  and her sister brie cuoco couldn't help  but get emotional when first  seeing her over-the-top look  kaylie's stylist brad goreski teased her  sparkling oscar de la renta number  ahead of the show living it during this  time right now  and and also being very um conscious of  what is going on  in the world um but then also on the  flip side of that  too you know having a little bit of fun  right now and bringing a little bit of  glitz and sparkle you know back into the  world  tiffany haddish was glamorous in her  custom brown and silver embellished  alberta ferretti gown  as she was there presenting the award  for best animated motion picture  tiffany paired the look with statement  earrings a metallic clutch  and her cropped blonde hairdo as the  award show  was a mostly virtual event a laid back  style was to be expected  and there were definitely a few more  subdued looks of the night with margot  robbie's off-the-shoulder metallic and  black chanel frock  and chain-link purse  to jodie foster's prada pajamas  and there was jason tzedekis's cozy  ensemble  the actor accepted his award for best  actor in a comedy series  for his role in ted lasso rocking a neon  green  and blue tie-dye hoodie while at home  that feels like home to me that makes me  feel very at home  also if anybody wants to know where they  can get jason sedakis's hoodie go to  nbc.com  backslash globes fashion  [Applause]  [Music]

